                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Choate to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1900-06-20"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 20,
                    1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Choate requests that Mr. Geldart state the price that will reimburse him for
                    shipments on the <hi rendition="#italic">Mashona.</hi>)</p>
            </div>
